[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2605298198","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101882#issuecomment-2605298198","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101882","id":2605298198,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bSbIW","user":{"login":"stryker313","id":83078010,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzMDc4MDEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83078010?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stryker313","html_url":"https://github.com/stryker313","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stryker313/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stryker313/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stryker313/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stryker313/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stryker313/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stryker313/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stryker313/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stryker313/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stryker313/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-21T17:09:34Z","updated_at":"2025-01-21T17:09:34Z","body":"For reference, here is a video of loading this script in 4.3\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7024db83-0cbb-4a36-a59f-b7adf58f84d7","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2605298198/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2607076532","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101882#issuecomment-2607076532","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101882","id":2607076532,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bZNS0","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-22T12:08:27Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T12:11:22Z","body":"Profile result:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7cff795a-d495-4f05-b05a-df23ef9f2539)\n\nSo this is yet another editor performance issue bottlenecked by `TextServerAdvanced`. I feel like there are enough similar issues to  create a tracker for them.\n\nSome issues that come to my mind immediately:  \n- In `TextServerAdvanced::_shape_run`, there is a `Vector<Glyph>::push_back` that appears to be a bottleneck and spends a significant amount of time on memory allocation because it does not use `reserve` or `resize` before the loop. The same applies to `TextServerAdvanced::_shape_substr`.  \n- The `CodeEdit::_update_delimiter_cache` function accounts for about 10% of the execution time. The performance bottleneck lies in the `String::length` call, which leads to memory access (the length of the `String` is stored in `CowData`, located at the beginning of the data structure).  \n\nHaven't tested but I guess switch to `text_server_fb` can address this issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2607076532/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":5},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2614122149","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101882#issuecomment-2614122149","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101882","id":2614122149,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b0Fal","user":{"login":"redsett","id":17795893,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3Nzk1ODkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17795893?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/redsett","html_url":"https://github.com/redsett","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redsett/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redsett/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redsett/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redsett/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redsett/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redsett/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redsett/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redsett/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redsett/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-25T22:39:54Z","updated_at":"2025-01-25T22:39:54Z","body":"As a person who does most of my gdscript dev in the editor, these slow downs has been fairly painful in big projects. To the point where I started using an external editor.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2614122149/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631165014","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101882#issuecomment-2631165014","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101882","id":2631165014,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c1GRW","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-03T14:30:19Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T15:23:16Z","body":"I've also profiled the problem (20s lag spike on load on my end), to see if I can glean anything different.\n\nLet's start with the call stack:\n\n<img width=\"1512\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/85a2d6be-162c-4297-8838-122d63df7ede\" />\n\nHere we can see that each `set_text` and `shape_lines` take up ~40% of performance, while `GDScriptCache` takes ~10%. It is possible that unnecessary repeated calculations are performed here, but I cannot say for sure.\nAll in all it's not super unexpected for this to be slow, but there it is possible that top-down improvements could be made to avoid repeated calculations. However, this may be a difficult change requiring deep insight on the advanced text server.\n\nLet's look at the inverted call stack too:\n\n<img width=\"1511\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fc0a58be-e995-405e-be2b-e098ae7a533d\" />\n\nThis one is even more fragmented, but there are practical suggestions made by it:\n\n- `3.83 Gc   8,9 %\t  u_strFromUTF8WithSub_76_godot`\n    - I have recently improved this (unmerged as of yet): https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102129\n        - Notably, my PR comes with a risk of increased RAM use.\n    - There may be more improvement to be had by using pools for break iterators.\n- `3.22 Gc   7,5 %\t  std::__1::recursive_mutex::unlock()` / `2.58 Gc   6,0 %\t  std::__1::recursive_mutex::lock()`\n    - It should be possible to restructure `TextServerAdvanced` to use non-recursive mutexes to improve performance here.\n        - Edit: I tested just exchanging it, unfortunately it does seem like the current code does require on recursion. Would require a deeper dive to get rid of it.\n- `2.76 Gc   6,4 %\t  CodeEdit::_update_delimiter_cache(int, int)`\n    - It should be possible to benchmark this function to squeeze better performance from it.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631165014/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2632758201","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101882#issuecomment-2632758201","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101882","id":2632758201,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c7LO5","user":{"login":"stryker313","id":83078010,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzMDc4MDEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83078010?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stryker313","html_url":"https://github.com/stryker313","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stryker313/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stryker313/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stryker313/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stryker313/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stryker313/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stryker313/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stryker313/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stryker313/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stryker313/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T03:52:42Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T03:52:42Z","body":"@Ivorforce \n\n> All in all it's not super unexpected for this to be slow\n\nI wouldn't have made an issue, as I understand that opening a 100K file is not ideal in any way, but the thing is that Godot 3.6 can load the script almost instantaneously (see above, using 3.6....)\n\nFurthermore, there is a drastic speed difference between 4.4 beta 1 and other 4.0 builds. (Try something like 4.0,4.1 and you will see that the loading speed is FAR FAR worse; I assume that the speedup in 4.4 is due to the new editor performance upgrades in 4.4).\n\nThe script load speed difference/downgrade between Godot 3 and Godot 4 is very interesting; is it truly just a \"TextServerAdvanced\" thing?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2632758201/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2632928470","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101882#issuecomment-2632928470","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101882","id":2632928470,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c70zW","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T05:41:44Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T05:41:44Z","body":"> The script load speed difference/downgrade between Godot 3 and Godot 4 is very interesting; is it truly just a \"TextServerAdvanced\" thing?\n\nCorrect me if I'm wrong, but I think TextServerFallBack is exactly the text server we use in Godot 3, it lacks the support for some advanced functionalities like BiDi so it is not the default choice but it is really fast :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2632928470/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2633376082","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101882#issuecomment-2633376082","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101882","id":2633376082,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c9iFS","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T09:43:35Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T09:43:35Z","body":"I don't mean to say it's _supposed_ to be slow :)\nBy \"not unexpected\" i just mean there's nothing _obvious_ that's going wrong, so a fix is unfortunately harder to conjure than if there was.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2633376082/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2633504877","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101882#issuecomment-2633504877","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101882","id":2633504877,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c-Bht","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T10:34:52Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T10:35:56Z","body":"Note that TextServerFallback is not compiled in by default, so you need to compile the editor with `module_text_server_fb_enabled=yes`. Make sure to use other optimizations when compiling to match official builds (`production=yes`).\n\nAfter compiling it, change the text driver in the project settings to Fallback. This will affect the editor on the current project after restarting.\n\nYou can also check performance without any text rendering by using the Dummy text driver (`--text-driver Dummy` on the command line). No text will appear when using this text driver.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2633504877/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2633573696","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101882#issuecomment-2633573696","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101882","id":2633573696,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c-SVA","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T11:04:07Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T11:05:31Z","body":"CC @bruvzg \n\nAs pointed out, Godot 4 has more advanced text features than Godot 3, and these features come at a cost. So it's not unexpected that Godot 4 has worth performance on huge texts than Godot 3.\n\nThat being said, if profiling can identify some low hanging fruits to improve performance of TextServerAdvanced, that would be great.\n\nFor extremely long files, we could also consider disabling support for some features when detecting such files to avoid too high a performance cost. And show a popup informing the user about it, with the possibility to re-enable them (Kate does this e.g. when loading files with line lengths that exceed a reasonable number).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2633573696/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2633589765","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101882#issuecomment-2633589765","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101882","id":2633589765,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c-WQF","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T11:11:04Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T11:11:12Z","body":"For extremely long files we probably should implement threaded loading, there might be parts of `TextServer` that can be optimized (a lot of optimizations already done for 4.4, and it should significantly faster than 4.3), but it will always be slower than zero processing in 3.x.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2633589765/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]